<div class="help-card">
  <h1 class="text-center">Help & FAQs</h1>
  
  <h2 class="section-title">
    <span class="icon">❓</span>
    Getting Started
  </h2>
  <ul class="faq-list">
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>How do I start a chat?</strong><br>
        Simply click on one of the chat options (Video, Voice, or Text) on the homepage to get matched with someone.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Is FreeYap free to use?</strong><br>
        Yes, FreeYap is completely free to use. No hidden charges or premium features.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Do I need to create an account?</strong><br>
        No, you can start chatting immediately without registration.
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="section-title">
    <span class="icon">🛡️</span>
    Safety & Privacy
  </h2>
  <ul class="faq-list">
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>How can I report inappropriate behavior?</strong><br>
        Use the "Report" button during chat to flag any violations. Our moderators review reports 24/7.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Can others see my personal information?</strong><br>
        No, we don't share any personal information. Your privacy is our priority.
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="section-title">
    <span class="icon">🎯</span>
    Topics & Matching
  </h2>
  <ul class="faq-list">
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>How does topic matching work?</strong><br>
        Add topics of interest, and we'll try to match you with users who share similar interests.
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="icon">Q</span>
      <div>
        <strong>Can I change topics during a chat?</strong><br>
        Yes, you can update your topics anytime, even during an active chat.
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
